  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards low carbon transport: Piloting e-mobility within Belize&apos;s public transport system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project supports to shift to electric mobility with the introduction of the first e-buses in the country. It enables a policy framework supporting, focuses on demonstrating conditions and experience for e-mobility integration into the national system, informing sector growth and investment planning.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
